          <p><strong>Product.</strong> We import a carefully selected collection of roasted beans. Why beans? Because when you grind them fresh, you open a fresh bit of Italy in your cup.</p>
          <p><strong>People.</strong> From our team to our roasters to our customers, we are a group passionate about coffee - and the culture around it.</p>
        </div>
        <p>At the core, it&rsquo;s always about people. These three P&rsquo;s set our tone, define who we are, and shape our principles.</p>
