      {%- endcomment -%}
      <h3>Damage replacement</h3>
      <p>If a bag arrives damaged, tell us and we will replace it.</p>
      <h3>Freshness window</h3>
      <p>We airfreight coffee freshly roasted in Italy, in the roaster&rsquo;s own sealed bags, and ship it to you with ample time to enjoy. Every bag carries its roast date, and no bag sells from our shelves once that date is older than {{ settings.freshness_window_days }} days.</p>
      <h3>Our no-waste pledge</h3>
      <p>We set a higher standard for freshness than most, because we want you to taste what the roaster intended. Coffee older than our selling window is still good coffee, and under our no-waste pledge it goes to other good uses, including charitable donations.</p>
